WEBVTT

00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:07.870
Later.

00:00:07.870 --> 00:00:08.860
See you.

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:09.980
See you.

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:13.740
Do you have club work today, Tazuki?

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:14.490
Yeah.

00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:16.500
Are you headed home now?

00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:17.790
Yeah.

00:00:17.790 --> 00:00:19.400
I'm worried about Mii-kun.

00:00:19.730 --> 00:00:20.870
Ah.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.580
<b>Kamiya Tazuki</b>

00:00:21.410 --> 00:00:22.500
Here, then.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:23.620
Notes for English class.

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:26.280
I'll come to your place after club work.

00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:27.680
Have it copied by then.

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:31.760
You're in trouble if you bomb 
the next exam, aren't you?

00:00:32.820 --> 00:00:34.600
I'll study with you.

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:36.440
We need to start early.

00:00:36.440 --> 00:00:37.880
R-Right.

00:00:37.880 --> 00:00:39.410
Sorry this happens all the time.

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:45.100
<i>After club work, huh?</i>

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:48.660
<i>I think I can make dinner before 
I start copying his notes.</i>

00:02:34.880 --> 00:02:39.800
Toyed With and Chased Around,
Being Small Is Hard

00:02:39.730 --> 00:02:41.110
I'm home.

00:02:44.580 --> 00:02:46.300
He's dried up again!

00:02:50.180 --> 00:02:54.490
Say, Mii-kun, are you drinking 
water while I'm out?

00:02:57.530 --> 00:03:00.190
Why does he keep getting dried up, then?

00:03:07.380 --> 00:03:09.500
I'll think about it while I make dinner.

00:03:14.530 --> 00:03:17.250
What are you doing?!

00:03:23.390 --> 00:03:24.770
<i>Could it be...</i>

00:03:28.840 --> 00:03:32.660
<i>you still haven't given up 
on helping with the chores?</i>

00:03:35.350 --> 00:03:36.270
I know.

00:03:41.600 --> 00:03:42.210
There.

00:03:42.210 --> 00:03:43.620
Your knife.

00:03:50.800 --> 00:03:52.440
Are you that happy?

00:03:55.720 --> 00:03:57.920
All right, time for you to start helping.

00:03:58.780 --> 00:03:59.570
Here.

00:04:12.870 --> 00:04:14.540
<i>It's missing something.</i>

00:04:15.650 --> 00:04:17.960
<i>I think I'll try adding a little garlic.</i>

00:04:22.790 --> 00:04:24.440
<i>Good, he's managing.</i>

00:04:49.010 --> 00:04:51.180
Ow!

00:04:51.530 --> 00:04:54.240
A-Are you all right, Mii-kun?

00:04:56.640 --> 00:04:57.480
What?

00:04:58.740 --> 00:05:00.940
Were you trying to get the cucumber?

00:05:10.210 --> 00:05:12.830
No, I'm sorry, too.

00:05:12.830 --> 00:05:15.510
I should have kept a better eye on you.

00:05:19.230 --> 00:05:21.470
Jeez, don't cry.

00:05:26.110 --> 00:05:27.940
Don't cry like that.

00:05:39.530 --> 00:05:40.700
Hot!

00:05:40.700 --> 00:05:42.610
That's crazy friction!

00:05:47.300 --> 00:05:49.340
Something smells good.

00:05:51.790 --> 00:05:54.450
It's going to be curry rice tonight.

00:05:59.030 --> 00:06:00.180
There.

00:06:00.180 --> 00:06:02.250
All set for dinner.

00:06:05.280 --> 00:06:06.840
Man, that Tazuki...

00:06:06.840 --> 00:06:08.260
He makes it so clear.

00:06:18.020 --> 00:06:19.520
Hey! Hey, hey!

00:06:19.850 --> 00:06:21.710
You can't crumple it like that!

00:06:21.710 --> 00:06:23.310
That belongs to Tazuki.

00:06:26.640 --> 00:06:27.560
What's wrong?

00:06:27.970 --> 00:06:29.700
You want to turn pages, too?

00:06:37.310 --> 00:06:39.920
What are you doing, Kashiwagi?

00:06:40.810 --> 00:06:41.980
Um...

00:06:42.420 --> 00:06:44.190
Making a picture book for Mii-kun.

00:06:45.050 --> 00:06:47.250
You've finished copying my notes, right?

00:06:47.710 --> 00:06:49.800
Yes... Mostly...

00:06:51.990 --> 00:06:53.420
Sorry, Tazuki.

00:06:53.420 --> 00:06:55.490
Mii-kun wrinkled it.

00:06:55.490 --> 00:06:57.790
Yeah, as long as I can read it.

00:06:57.790 --> 00:06:58.680
It's fine.

00:07:02.850 --> 00:07:05.530
Oh, yeah, I made some snacks.

00:07:05.530 --> 00:07:06.750
Hang on.

00:07:25.510 --> 00:07:26.280
Here.

00:07:26.280 --> 00:07:27.630
Pumpkin Mont Blanc.

00:07:28.500 --> 00:07:29.460
Thanks.

00:07:29.460 --> 00:07:31.070
Have some tea, too.

00:07:33.110 --> 00:07:34.640
What's wrong, Mii-kun?

00:07:34.640 --> 00:07:36.360
Are you still afraid of Tazuki?

00:07:38.760 --> 00:07:40.120
It looks good.

00:07:43.720 --> 00:07:45.900
That's a tasty-looking mummy.

00:07:47.830 --> 00:07:49.950
Want to take home a few Mont Blancs?

00:07:49.950 --> 00:07:51.800
Really? Thanks.

00:07:52.160 --> 00:07:53.780
Hang on, I'm going to go pack them.

00:07:54.250 --> 00:07:55.870
Wait here, Mii-kun.

00:08:07.410 --> 00:08:08.660
<i>Now, then...</i>

00:08:08.660 --> 00:08:11.540
<i>How do I get him to let me touch him?</i>

00:08:17.040 --> 00:08:18.770
Want a bite?

00:08:20.380 --> 00:08:25.560
And in the end, when you're 
all fattened up, I'll eat <i>you</i>!

00:08:30.270 --> 00:08:34.910
<i>You being so afraid of me makes 
me want to mess with you more.</i>

00:09:01.860 --> 00:09:03.560
Gotcha.

00:09:06.190 --> 00:09:08.520
<i>Whoa, he's so soft.</i>

00:09:09.690 --> 00:09:12.280
<i>What's he made of inside?</i>

00:09:12.950 --> 00:09:16.030
Oh, good, is Mii-kun getting used to you?

00:09:16.030 --> 00:09:18.110
You're playing with him, huh?

00:09:18.110 --> 00:09:18.910
Yeah.

00:09:18.910 --> 00:09:21.660
I can't find the end of his bandage.

00:09:21.660 --> 00:09:23.790
What the heck are you doing, dude?!

00:09:23.790 --> 00:09:25.700
You can't take the bandage off!

00:09:25.700 --> 00:09:27.670
It even said so on my dad's letter.

00:09:28.290 --> 00:09:31.800
Sorry, I just got really 
curious about what's inside.

00:09:34.580 --> 00:09:35.770
Tazuki...

00:09:36.520 --> 00:09:38.660
I've been thinking...

00:09:39.170 --> 00:09:44.560
Maybe the bandage is to Mii-kun 
what skin is to humans.

00:09:46.140 --> 00:09:47.360
Say, Tazuki...

00:09:48.770 --> 00:09:51.870
What do you think comes out 
when you skin a person?

00:09:54.110 --> 00:09:55.720
Do you still want to see?

00:09:56.700 --> 00:09:57.910
I'm sorry.

00:10:06.580 --> 00:10:08.240
Here, Tazuki.

00:10:11.270 --> 00:10:12.550
<i>Dog food?</i>

00:10:13.700 --> 00:10:17.090
You might be able to make 
up with Mii-kun with it.

00:10:19.090 --> 00:10:19.790
You...

00:10:23.170 --> 00:10:24.320
Uh...

00:10:29.820 --> 00:10:30.750
Mii.

00:10:32.560 --> 00:10:35.810
Sorry about what I did.

00:10:39.390 --> 00:10:40.680
Want some...

00:10:41.860 --> 00:10:42.840
dog food?

00:11:15.050 --> 00:11:16.890
Look what I got

00:11:15.550 --> 00:11:17.390
Look what I got

00:11:18.120 --> 00:11:19.870
Good for you, Mii-kun.

00:11:19.870 --> 00:11:21.720
Tazuki gave you food?

00:11:23.070 --> 00:11:24.290
Kashiwagi...

00:11:25.350 --> 00:11:30.790
Mii is so cute, I couldn't 
even think to mess with him.

00:11:32.090 --> 00:11:34.000
Is there something wrong with me?

00:11:34.520 --> 00:11:35.840
You're normal.

00:11:35.840 --> 00:11:37.050
Relax.

00:11:38.030 --> 00:11:41.710
Speaking of which, 
Mii-kun was dried up again.

00:11:41.710 --> 00:11:43.230
Again?

00:11:43.830 --> 00:11:45.650
I don't know why.

00:11:45.650 --> 00:11:49.060
I'll have to take him to school 
if he's dried up again tomorrow.

00:11:49.610 --> 00:11:50.810
You're kidding, right?

00:11:53.940 --> 00:11:56.130
Wait, you're kidding, right?

00:11:57.620 --> 00:11:58.980
Should I not?

00:12:34.730 --> 00:12:37.730
<b>Chemistry Room</b>

00:12:35.770 --> 00:12:37.730
You actually brought him here?

00:12:37.730 --> 00:12:40.480
He was dried up four days in a row.

00:12:40.820 --> 00:12:44.480
I don't know what's causing it, so I 
was afraid to let him be alone.

00:12:44.860 --> 00:12:46.300
I see.

00:12:46.300 --> 00:12:48.030
Be careful not to get caught.

00:12:49.440 --> 00:12:52.330
I made him promise to stay quiet, but...

00:12:57.480 --> 00:12:58.630
A-Are you all right?

00:13:05.190 --> 00:13:06.360
Oh, no...

00:13:06.940 --> 00:13:08.480
No, Mii-kun.

00:13:08.480 --> 00:13:11.200
A promise is a promise.

00:13:11.760 --> 00:13:14.020
He's a lot of work, huh, Kashiwagi?

00:13:16.330 --> 00:13:21.030
But it would be really bad if 
someone saw you moving, okay?

00:13:21.560 --> 00:13:24.890
Can you promise me again that 
you'll pretend to be a stuffed toy

00:13:24.890 --> 00:13:26.550
when you're outside?

00:13:28.620 --> 00:13:30.520
Don't break that promise.

00:13:31.720 --> 00:13:34.560
You should probably keep Mii in your desk.

00:13:35.100 --> 00:13:38.980
Someone might kick him if 
you keep him in the aisle.

00:13:39.420 --> 00:13:40.670
Oh, yeah.

00:13:43.320 --> 00:13:45.020
There, that looks good.

00:13:45.020 --> 00:13:46.180
Come here, Mii-kun.

00:13:46.630 --> 00:13:47.390
Come.

00:13:47.390 --> 00:13:48.520
Into the desk.

00:13:52.480 --> 00:13:53.690
Did you just sneeze?

00:13:53.690 --> 00:13:54.810
What's that?

00:13:56.390 --> 00:13:58.180
A mummy doll?

00:13:58.180 --> 00:13:59.560
It's so cute.

00:13:59.560 --> 00:14:01.510
M-Motegi-san...

00:14:04.070 --> 00:14:06.140
Is that yours, Sora-chan?

00:14:06.140 --> 00:14:07.570
Y-Yeah...

00:14:07.570 --> 00:14:12.660
You're quite the criminal, 
bringing your stuffed toy to school.

00:14:14.150 --> 00:14:15.080
Sure.

00:14:15.570 --> 00:14:18.330
<i>She didn't hear that sneeze, did she?</i>

00:14:18.330 --> 00:14:22.010
I've never seen a sneezing 
stuffed toy, though.

00:14:22.010 --> 00:14:23.960
What else can it do?

00:14:24.600 --> 00:14:26.970
<i>She totally heard it!</i>

00:14:26.970 --> 00:14:28.820
Oh, the sneeze?

00:14:28.820 --> 00:14:30.880
That must have been me.

00:14:31.780 --> 00:14:33.470
I sneeze a lot these days.

00:14:38.940 --> 00:14:41.870
I get so sneezy these days.

00:14:40.040 --> 00:14:41.870
Are you all right?

00:14:42.270 --> 00:14:43.480
<i>That's a cough.</i>

00:14:43.480 --> 00:14:45.030
<i>That's a cough, Kashiwagi.</i>

00:14:46.080 --> 00:14:48.990
It's so cute, though.

00:14:51.970 --> 00:14:53.700
It's so pudgy.

00:14:53.700 --> 00:14:55.290
It feels so nice.

00:14:55.290 --> 00:14:56.310
<i>Uh oh...</i>

00:14:55.290 --> 00:14:57.880
Pudge pudge, pudge pudge...

00:14:56.310 --> 00:14:57.940
<i>He can't take any more.</i>

00:14:59.440 --> 00:15:02.380
You can have it if you like 
it so much, Motegi-san.

00:15:07.670 --> 00:15:08.630
Done!

00:15:12.100 --> 00:15:14.710
Oh, so that's what you meant.

00:15:15.080 --> 00:15:17.200
Stuffed mummy dolls for Motegi-san.

00:15:17.200 --> 00:15:19.770
You can have one, too, Tazuki.

00:15:19.770 --> 00:15:21.550
R-Right.

00:15:23.270 --> 00:15:26.900
I'm impressed you put that 
together so quickly, though.

00:15:27.350 --> 00:15:28.700
Sora-chan.

00:15:28.700 --> 00:15:29.890
Motegi-san.

00:15:31.410 --> 00:15:33.560
Look at all these cuties.

00:15:33.560 --> 00:15:35.350
I can have one?

00:15:36.330 --> 00:15:36.910
Yeah.

00:15:38.820 --> 00:15:40.160
Thanks.

00:15:40.160 --> 00:15:41.680
I'll take good care of it.

00:15:43.600 --> 00:15:44.920
Thank goodness.

00:15:44.920 --> 00:15:45.770
Now...

00:15:48.140 --> 00:15:51.380
She took the real Mii-kun!

00:15:54.490 --> 00:15:56.680
It's so pudgy.

00:15:56.680 --> 00:15:58.960
I can't find any seams anywhere.

00:15:58.960 --> 00:16:01.690
Sora-chan's such a girly girl.

00:16:05.850 --> 00:16:09.690
<i>Mii-kun, I'm sorry, I was right there, too.</i>

00:16:13.620 --> 00:16:15.710
S-Sorry, I didn't hurt you, did I?

00:16:28.400 --> 00:16:30.090
He might be back in class.

00:16:39.910 --> 00:16:41.780
Go away, pervert!

00:16:42.100 --> 00:16:44.020
Jeez, you scared me.

00:16:44.020 --> 00:16:46.110
It's Phys Ed next!

00:16:46.110 --> 00:16:48.110
<b>Girls' Changing Room</b>

00:17:30.280 --> 00:17:31.690
Towel, towel!

00:17:35.160 --> 00:17:36.320
Found it.

00:18:08.420 --> 00:18:10.710
Run hard, kids.

00:18:10.710 --> 00:18:12.070
Okay.

00:18:14.330 --> 00:18:15.370
That's it!

00:18:16.780 --> 00:18:18.250
Keep it up!

00:18:18.800 --> 00:18:23.290
I don't see Mii, but that bag is suspicious.

00:18:23.800 --> 00:18:24.600
What's the plan?

00:18:40.860 --> 00:18:42.980
You can take a break when you finish.

00:18:45.070 --> 00:18:48.460
I'm going to finish the marathon 
quick, and go to Motegi-san.

00:18:53.070 --> 00:18:55.070
What's up with that starting dash?

00:18:55.070 --> 00:18:57.280
Kashiwagi's way too fast.

00:19:23.550 --> 00:19:25.730
You're as fast as always, Kashiwagi.

00:19:25.730 --> 00:19:27.180
I'm going to take a break!

00:19:39.240 --> 00:19:40.290
Motegi-san!

00:19:41.030 --> 00:19:43.160
What's the matter, Sora-chan?

00:19:43.160 --> 00:19:44.030
Um...

00:19:44.030 --> 00:19:46.390
What's in the bag?

00:19:46.390 --> 00:19:49.350
Huh? Oh, this?

00:19:49.350 --> 00:19:50.360
This is...

00:19:50.900 --> 00:19:51.880
<i>Mii-kun!</i>

00:19:51.880 --> 00:19:52.960
<i>There you are!</i>

00:19:53.280 --> 00:19:54.890
Want to use my towel?

00:20:07.330 --> 00:20:08.130
Well?

00:20:08.130 --> 00:20:08.740
Where's Mii?

00:20:08.740 --> 00:20:10.240
She said it's in the changing room.

00:20:10.240 --> 00:20:11.230
I'm going to go check it out.

00:20:11.230 --> 00:20:13.020
No, it's the girls' changing room.

00:20:13.020 --> 00:20:14.390
You aren't getting in that easily.

00:20:14.390 --> 00:20:16.350
But I have to hurry!

00:20:23.030 --> 00:20:24.240
Mii-kun!

00:20:32.610 --> 00:20:33.960
Kashiwagi, get Mii.

00:20:33.960 --> 00:20:34.870
Right.

00:20:34.870 --> 00:20:36.250
Mii-kun, are you okay?

00:20:36.250 --> 00:20:37.240
Are you hurt?

00:20:40.310 --> 00:20:42.350
Don't break that promise.

00:20:56.380 --> 00:20:57.910
It's okay, Mii-kun.

00:20:57.910 --> 00:21:00.190
You don't have to pretend to 
be a stuffed toy right now.

00:21:13.340 --> 00:21:16.040
I'm so glad you're safe.

00:21:24.180 --> 00:21:25.800
Sorry, Sora-chan.

00:21:26.280 --> 00:21:30.310
I lost the stuffed toy that you made for me.

00:21:30.310 --> 00:21:32.020
I'm really sorry.

00:21:34.250 --> 00:21:36.600
I found it on the hallway floor.

00:21:37.150 --> 00:21:38.890
Oh, really?

00:21:41.440 --> 00:21:43.020
Thank goodness.

00:21:52.040 --> 00:21:55.110
Mii-kun, what do you want to 
do about school, tomorrow?

00:21:56.390 --> 00:22:00.510
You didn't dry up yesterday, 
so I want you to come if you can.

00:22:00.970 --> 00:22:03.200
You don't have to if you 
don't want to, though.

00:22:04.400 --> 00:22:09.830
Spend time
with Sora

00:22:04.400 --> 00:22:09.830
School's a
bit scary

00:22:17.530 --> 00:22:18.570
All right.

00:23:50.750 --> 00:23:53.780
Mii-kun's starting to like school more.

00:23:53.780 --> 00:23:57.750
He waits eagerly at the 
door when it's time to go.

00:23:57.750 --> 00:23:59.830
Today's Sunday, though.

00:23:59.730 --> 00:24:04.670
Next Episode
It's Scary When Someone You Care About Gets Sick

00:24:00.580 --> 00:24:01.850
<i>How to Keep a Mummy</i>.

00:24:01.850 --> 00:24:03.360
See you next time.

00:24:04.670 --> 00:24:08.730
<b>See you again!</b>
